          "depth": 2,
          "epoch": 1,
          "hypothesis": "Computing each anti-diagonal without obstacle checks in the cell loop, then zeroing its sparse blocked positions, should reduce per-cell memory traffic and masking while leaving the independent recurrence loops easier for GCC to SIMD-vectorize.",
