          "epoch": 1,
          "hypothesis": "A flat row-major uint64_t adjacency layout with per-permutation row-degree checks can avoid most per-cell proxy accesses. When mapped row degrees match, checking only set bits in the symmetric lower triangle proves equality while reducing sparse-graph checks to O(n+E) per permutation.",
