              "Added #include <arm_neon.h> and <string.h>",
              "Replaced linear insertion sort with binary search + memmove (insert_sorted)",
              "Initialized distances array with __builtin_inff() instead of -1 to simplify comparisons",
              "Hoisted to_evaluate.x/y into local variables px, py",
              "Added NEON batch processing for 4 points using vld2q_f32 and vector arithmetic",
              "Added __builtin_prefetch for upcoming cache lines (8 points ahead)",
              "Scalar remainder loop handles leftover points"
            ]
          },
